.TH XIL\-PRODUCE "1" "2026\-08\-09" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-produce
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-produce
[-h] (--episode EPISODE | --tag TAG) [--show SHOW] [--script SCRIPT] [--dry-run] [--reconcile] [--apply] [--force] [--start-from START_FROM] [--stop-at STOP_AT] [--terse] [--gen-sfx] [--gen-music] [--gen-ambience] [--sfx-music] [--local-only] [--backend BACKEND] [--chatterbox-python PATH] [--voice-refs DIR] [--sfx-backend BACKEND] [--mmaudio-python PATH] [--mmaudio-duration FLOAT] [--mmaudio-cfg FLOAT] [--mmaudio-steps INT] [--mmaudio-negative-prompt STR] [--mmaudio-seed INT] [--mmaudio-accept-noncommercial]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Voice Generation — generate voice stems via ElevenLabs

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,EPISODE\/\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S01E01) — derives cast and SFX config paths

.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01)

.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SHOW\/\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-script\fR \fI\,SCRIPT\/\fR
Path to parsed script JSON (default: derived from cast config)

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview all lines and TTS cost without API calls

.TP
\fB\-\-reconcile\fR
Re\-link existing stems to new seq filenames after a re\-parse (reads stem
manifest, proposes renames, no TTS calls). Add \-\-apply to execute.

.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
With \-\-reconcile: execute the renames instead of dry\-run preview.

.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite existing stem files instead of skipping them. Use with \-\-range to
regenerate specific lines. WARNING: incurs ElevenLabs API cost for every stem
in range.

.TP
\fB\-\-start\-from\fR \fI\,START_FROM\/\fR
Start generation from sequence number N (for resuming)

.TP
\fB\-\-stop\-at\fR \fI\,STOP_AT\/\fR
Stop generation at sequence number N, inclusive (for previewing a section)

.TP
\fB\-\-terse\fR
Truncate each line to 3 words to minimize TTS character cost

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-sfx\fR
Generate SFX and BEAT stems

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-music\fR
Generate music stems

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-ambience\fR
Generate ambience stems

.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-music\fR
(deprecated) shorthand for \-\-gen\-sfx \-\-gen\-music \-\-gen\-ambience

.TP
\fB\-\-local\-only\fR
Only place stems for effects already present in SFX/; skip API generation

.TP
\fB\-\-backend\fR \fI\,BACKEND\/\fR
TTS backend for dialogue voice stems. 'elevenlabs' (default) calls the
ElevenLabs API. 'gtts' generates a flat\-voice draft via Google Translate TTS
at no cost — all characters sound the same, useful for checking episode
duration before spending API credits. 'chatterbox\-turbo' uses the local
Chatterbox Turbo model in venv\-chatterbox with per\-character voice cloning
from voice_refs/<key>.wav reference clips: it natively renders 19
paralinguistic tags — [angry] [fear] [surprised] [happy] [crying] [sarcastic]
[whispering] [dramatic] [narration] [advertisement] [laugh] [chuckle] [sigh]
[gasp] [groan] [cough] [sniff] [shush] [clear throat] — and strips every other
bracketed tag. Spelling is exact: there are no plural forms ([laugh], not
[laughs]). Requires reference clips >5s. 'chatterbox' is a deprecated alias
for 'chatterbox\-turbo' — it warns and generates with Turbo; classic Chatterbox
was removed. Requires: pip install xil\-pipeline[tts\-alt] (gtts) or a
configured venv\-chatterbox (chatterbox\-turbo).

.TP
\fB\-\-chatterbox\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the Python executable in the chatterbox venv (default: auto\-detect
./venv\-chatterbox/bin/python3). Used with \-\-backend chatterbox or chatterbox\-
turbo.

.TP
\fB\-\-voice\-refs\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Directory of <speaker_key>.wav reference clips for Chatterbox zero\-shot voice
cloning (default: <workspace>/voice_refs/). Missing refs fall back to
Chatterbox's default voice.

.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-backend\fR \fI\,BACKEND\/\fR
Backend for SFX/music/ambience generation, independent of the dialogue
\-\-backend. 'elevenlabs' (default) calls the ElevenLabs Sound Effects API.
'mmaudio' runs MMAudio locally in venv\-mmaudio — free and GPU\-accelerated,
writes backend\-tagged assets to SFX/<slug>.mmaudio.mp3. MMAudio's weights are
CC BY\-NC 4.0 (non\-commercial only) and require \-\-mmaudio\-accept\-noncommercial.

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the Python executable in the MMAudio venv (default: auto\-detect
./venv\-mmaudio/bin/python3). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend mmaudio.

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-duration\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
Generation length in seconds before trimming (default: 8.0, MMAudio's training
duration). The result is trimmed to each cue's duration_seconds; generating at
the native length and trimming gives better audio than asking for a short
clip.

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-cfg\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
MMAudio classifier\-free guidance strength (default: 4.5).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-steps\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
MMAudio flow\-matching sampling steps (default: 25).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-negative\-prompt\fR \fI\,STR\/\fR
Optional MMAudio negative prompt (default: none).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-seed\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
MMAudio reproducibility seed (default: nondeterministic).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-accept\-noncommercial\fR
Acknowledge that MMAudio's weights are CC BY\-NC 4.0 (NON\-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY)
and that generated audio must not appear in a monetised production. Required
for \-\-sfx\-backend mmaudio.

